ively. Integrity Upholding the highest ethical standards in all our operations, ensuring transparency and trust with clients, partners, and stakeholders. Sustainability Designing solutions that minimize environmental impact and promote sustainable development for future generations. Collaboration Working closely with clients, partners, contractors, and stakeholders to achieve shared success through open communication and teamwork.\", \"vision_english\": \"Be the leading and trusted engineering consultancy, delivering innovative, high-value solutions that shape the future of commercial and large-scale projects for businesses and individuals.\", \"company_profile\": null, \"mission_english\": \"Deliver innovative, technology-driven engineering solutions that empower clients, foster sustainability, and create lasting value through expert guidance, efficient project execution, and collaborative partnerships tailored to industry needs.\", \"subtitle_arabic\": null, \"page_cover_image\": \"/uploads/about/cover/1771615853_6998b66dbbc8e.webp\", \"subtitle_english\": \"Get to know More\"}', '[\"values_english\", \"values_arabic\", \"page_cover_image\"]', '197.52.61.252', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', 'Updated About Information \'About Us\' (values_english, values_arabic, page_cover_image)', '2026-02-20 21:30:53', '2026-02-20 21:30:53'),
