(887, 1, 'Momtaz', 'root@mail.com', 'update', 'App\\Models\\AboutInformation', 'About Information', 1, 'About Us', '{\"id\": 1, \"created_at\": \"2025-12-30T23:34:38.000000Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-02-20T19:55:52.000000Z\", \"about_image\": \"/uploads/about/about/1771616794_6998ba1ae91a0.webp\", \"about_arabic\": \"SVEC is an engineering consultancy established in 2013, delivering integrated design, engineering, and supervision services across residential, commercial, and industrial projects. We focus on practical solutions, regulatory compliance, and high-quality execution tailored to each client’s needs.\", \"title_arabic\": \"About Us\", \"values_image\": \"/uploads/about/values/1771617351_6998bc47f3d8a.webp\", \"vision_image\": \"/uploads/about/vision/1771617210_6998bbba29c98.webp\", \"about_english\": \"SVEC is an engineering consultancy established in 2013, delivering integrated design, engineering, and supervision services across residential, commercial, and industrial projects. We focus on practical solutions, regulatory compliance, and high-quality execution tailored to each client’s needs.\", \"mission_image\": \"/uploads/about/mission/1771617210_6998bbba0b0da.webp\", \"title_english\": \"About Us\", \"values_arabic\": \"Our approach is defined by a steadfast commitment to Excellence, where we deliver high-quality solutions that consistently exceed client expectations and set new industry benchmarks. We drive progress through Innovation, embracing cutting-edge technologies and creative methodologies to solve the most complex engineering challenges. This is built upon a foundation of Integrity, as we uphold the highest ethical standards to ensure transparency and trust with every partner and stakeholder. Furthermore, we prioritize Sustainability by designing solutions that minimize environmental impact and promote a better future, all while fostering a culture of Collaboration to achieve shared success through open communication and dedicated teamwork.\",